# The image holds the code and what it reads at run time, nothing else (PRD 11.4). Match data reaches the
# container on a volume, and truth never does (PRD 12.9).
*
!offball/
!contracts/
!calibration/*.json
!calibration/*.txt
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
